From ce8f5d7290850625f7dddbd6a636c6b5a2547d84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritam <ritamdotghosh@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 23:55:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix TUI compaction progress for native-auto providers

Replace remaining uses_jcode_compaction() guards with
supports_compaction() in all TUI code paths so native-auto
providers (e.g., opencode-go with auto compaction mode)
correctly show the compaction progress bar, completion
messages, and status notices.

Without this fix, the CompactionFinished bus event fires
correctly but the TUI never collects it because
poll_compaction_completion, status_notice, and is_compacting
all returned early for native-auto providers.

Files changed:
- conversation_state.rs: 6 guards (add_provider_message,
  reseed, messages_for_provider, poll_compaction_completion)
- tui_state.rs: 3 guards (status_notice, message skip, draw state)
- model_context.rs: 1 guard (update_compaction_usage_from_stream)
- state_ui.rs: 1 guard (info command jcode-managed label)
